#: ../source_code.rst:3
msgid "Galette source code"
msgstr "Izvorna koda Galette"

#: ../source_code.rst:5
msgid ""
"Galette sources are stored in `Git repositories <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Git>`_ on `Galette GitHub organization <https://github.com/galette/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Izvorne kode Galette so shranjene v `Git repozitorijih <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Git>`_ v organizaciji `Galette GitHub <https://"
"github.com/galette/>`_."

#: ../source_code.rst:7
msgid ""
"All repositories follow the same development model, therefore you will find "
"two branches in each:"
msgstr ""
"Vsi repozitoriji sledijo istemu razvojnemu modelu, zato boste v vsakem našli "
"dve veji:"

#: ../source_code.rst:9
msgid "``master``: this is always the latest stable release,"
msgstr "``master``: to je vedno najnovejša stabilna izdaja,"

#: ../source_code.rst:10
msgid "``develop``: the development version, which may be unstable."
msgstr "``develop``: razvojna različica, ki je lahko nestabilna."

