#: ../source_code.rst:32
msgid "Third-party libraries"
msgstr "Knjižnice tretjih oseb"

#: ../source_code.rst:34
msgid ""
"Galette's third-party dependencies are not included in the repository. "
"Instead, PHP dependencies are handled with `Composer dependency manager "
"<https://getcomposer.org>`_ and JavaScript ones with `Node Package Manager "
"(npm) <https://npmjs.com>`_ and `gulp <https://gulpjs.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Galetteine odvisnosti od tretjih oseb niso vključene v repozitorij. Namesto "
"tega se odvisnosti PHP obravnavajo z `Composer dependency manager <https://"
"getcomposer.org>`_, odvisnosti JavaScript pa z `Node Package Manager (npm) "
"<https://npmjs.com>`_ in `gulp <https://gulpjs.com/>`_."

#: ../source_code.rst:37
msgid ""
"In order to install all third party dependencies, just go to the Galette "
"source directory and run:"
msgstr ""
